# core/brain — layering rules. Written, not generated.
#
# One line here is narrower than any generated rule can be. Frontier
# certification takes the exact paired test from core.evaluation and nothing
# else from that package, so the rule names the module:
# `+core.evaluation.paired_power`. A generated DEPS emits package-level rules
# only, so regenerating this widens it to the whole of core.evaluation and
# the gate goes on passing while the rule it was holding is gone.
#
# Everything else below is the closed-world list the generator wrote: what
# this package imports today, and nothing else. A new cross-package edge is
# an edit to this file.

